# Hot Aisle: Core league, track 1. Fast and wide: four long passes across
# the hot aisle joined by sweeping turns. East along the top with no rail
# on the driver's left (the drop to the map edge) past two hot spots, round
# the east end and back west through the middle on the cold aisle (refill
# the thermal bar here), down and east again along the lower middle pass,
# open on the right this time with two more hot spots, then the overclock
# pad into the bottom straight west, open on the left, and up the long west
# side to the line. Control point 0 is the start line; features on point
# i apply to the segment from point i to i+1; open:left / open:right open
# only the driver's left or right side (the other side keeps its rail).
league core
width 64
# x    y    half   features
 280  130   66                     # start line, east along the top
 560  150   66     open:left hot:2 # the top straight: no rail on the left
 820  135   64
 912  235   62
 890  355   62
 760  410   62     cold            # back west through the middle: the cold aisle
 440  400   62
 318  455   60
 315  570   60
 420  625   62     open:right hot:2  # east along the lower middle, open on the right
 740  620   62
 905  705   62
 880  810   62
 780  880   64     pad             # overclock into the bottom straight
 520  840   66     open:left hot:2 # bottom straight west, open on the left
 250  890   66
 150  800   64
 150  560   64
 130  300   64
 180  170   66
